  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to support the Borrower#s strategy to foster the sustainable,  and equitable and efficient expansion of tertiary education through student assistance through the development of a coherent student assistance system consisting of grant programs and compensatory interventions for disadvantaged students and supporting the national tertiary education policy.</narrative>
  </description>
